{"version":1,"content":"<p>連鎖瑜伽健身中心「岩盤浴瑜伽有限公司 Hotstone Yoga」於上月底突宣布全線結業，其銅鑼灣分店的業主日前入稟高等法院，指 Hotstone Yoga未有如期繳交租金兼違約，向對方追討5.8萬元租金，並要求將單位交吉。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.162614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:14:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_hash":"3d23dc3f409d5c5ed1678e7ba90621b0ca83bc93d24b68c36d7574cbae13496b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}